  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The new civil society activity will aim to enhance the enabling environment for civil society through the following four objectives: 1. Strengthen csos domestic legitimacy 2. Enhance csos resilience to changing contexts 3. Advance trust-based relationships and inclusive networks among diverse civic actors 4. Increase public support for democratic values</narrative>
